OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers meet one last time to
OL,7,     Ffind out how much they've been
OL,8,     Fpaid and confront their critics.
OL,9,     FTension runs high, but who will be
OL,10,     Fcrowned best value B&B of the
OL,11,     Fweek?
OL,12,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,13,     FFrom snow-capped mountains to surf
OL,14,     Ftowns, Griff Rhys Jones concludes
OL,15,     Fhis adventure in the popular
OL,16,     Fprovince of British Columbia and
OL,17,     Fdiscovers what makes people so
OL,18,     Fhappy there. (Ep6/6)
