OL,5,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FAn 89-year-old woman refuses to go
OL,7,     Fto hospital for her continuous
OL,8,     Fvomiting. And a 93-year-old war
OL,9,     Fveteran desperately needs medical
OL,10,     Fattention for sepsis that could
OL,11,     Fkill him.
OL,12,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics must move a man who's
OL,14,     Fparalysed from the neck down - but
OL,15,     Fone false move and he may never
OL,16,     Fwalk again. And a man has chest
OL,17,     Fpains after being involved in a
OL,18,     Fhit-and-run.
